---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="xl:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="mt-1 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm leading-normal">
    <p>
      I turn complex research into production-grade AI. With a strong background in
      <b>Computer Vision</b> and <b>NLP</b>, I now focus on building <b>Agentic Systems</b> and
      <b>Generative AI</b> solutions.
    </p>
    <p>
      Beyond code, I focus on architecture and impact. I have engineered multi-agent workflows and
      hybrid retrieval systems that solve ambiguous problems, prioritizing observability and
      reliability in production.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-outside pl-4 marker:text-primary-500">
      <li>Architected autonomous multi-agent systems using LangGraph.</li>
      <li>Led a 20-person MLOps team for large-scale data initiatives.</li>
      <li>Optimized RAG pipelines reducing latency by 10x.</li>
      <li>Ranked Top 3% Kaggle Expert.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-muted">
      My stack: PyTorch, LangChain, LangGraph, FastAPI, Docker.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
